{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ArLtTvjXghzVEC8rGFtEER","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/sections/method.tex:24:Compared to trajectory-level labeling, windows provide the granularity needed to pinpoint \\emph{when} stagnation begins and ends within a single task attempt, enabling downstream interventions such as early termination or strategy switching."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CvWUtcAMRHJCy23iaZHmnA","session_id":"5d5323cd-d040-44cc-ba70-9f4e536cb20e","uuid":"4d1cb115-b797-495c-9529-3d124eca300a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:37:59.309Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017EnXo8peZ1ckhYWME8kGRW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2\t\"\"\"Compute waste audit: analyse stagnation tail waste in agent trajectories.\n3\t\n4\tInput:\n5\t  - SWE-Agent windows: {data_dir}/windows_labeled.jsonl\n6\t  - OH windows: {oh_dir}/windows_labeled.jsonl\n7\t  - SWE trajectories: {data_dir}/swe_agent_trajectories_5000.jsonl\n8\t  - OH trajectories: {oh_dir}/openhands_trajectories.jsonl\n9\t\n10\tOutput:\n11\t  - artifacts/d072/compute_waste_audit.json\n12\t    Per-trajectory stagnation tail analysis, grouped by agent type.\n13\t\n14\tLogic:\n15\t  For each trajectory, considering only conf>=2 windows:\n16\t    1. Sort windows by window_idx\n17\t    2. Find the stagnation onset: the earliest window such that all subsequent\n18\t       conf>=2 windows (from that point to the end) are stagnation.\n19\t    3. Compute tail_ratio = (total_steps - onset_step) / total_steps\n20\t\"\"\"\n21\t\n22\timport argparse\n23\timport json\n24\timport os\n25\timport sys\n26\tfrom collections import defaultdict\n27\tfrom pathlib import Path\n28\t\n29\timport numpy as np\n30\t\n31\t\n32\tdef load_windows(path):\n33\t    \"\"\"Load windows from JSONL file.\"\"\"\n34\t    windows = []\n35\t    with open(path) as f:\n36\t        for line in f:\n37\t            line = line.strip()\n38\t            if line:\n39\t                windows.append(json.loads(line))\n40\t    return windows\n41\t\n42\t\n43\tdef build_traj_step_counts(traj_path):\n44\t    \"\"\"Build mapping from trajectory_id -> total number of steps.\"\"\"\n45\t    counts = {}\n46\t    with open(traj_path) as f:\n47\t        for row_idx, line in enumerate(f):\n48\t            line = line.strip()\n49\t            if not line:\n50\t                continue"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01A9kMh3ZhLJdi8fxaMkWqoB","session_id":"5d5323cd-d040-44cc-ba70-9f4e536cb20e","uuid":"a339d4e9-1144-4413-b5b5-5d74204bef90","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:37:59.252Z"}
